Package: linwin-update-center
Version: 1.0.3-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), zenity, pkexec, apt, dpkg, ca-certificates, gpgv
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Maintainer: LinWin Update Center contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/sudipdasin/LinWin
Description: Graphical release updater companion for LinWin on XFCE
 Checks official LinWin releases and verifies Debian package checksums.
 Supports compatible Mint 22, Ubuntu 24.04 and Debian 13 amd64 systems.
 Automatic checks run at XFCE login; installation requires approval.
